{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065355/block/singleImage/3276060/df/01M85N8H8JG7P5BDK8FDFKC5CC.jpg?updatedAt=1795486570\"/><figcaption>油麻地文英街文景樓。（Google地圖截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>油麻地發生企圖自殺 今日（24日）早上7時07分，一名女子於油麻地文英街文景樓單位內持刀，企圖自殺，其丈夫擔心同時傷及嬰兒，連忙報警求助。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，警員身穿戰術背心及手持盾牌，其後成功控制該名女子，將她送往廣華醫院檢查，事件中無人受傷。警方正在調查事件起因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:43:56.686117+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:16:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T02:36:03.525917+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T03:37:19.686663+00:00","content_hash":"76704a913df1f5200445b975f479e6cf7cf1df534d38dd3cdb11050e4708fd80","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:43:56.686117+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}